    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Which credential path (governed vs not)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 22
      },
      "id": 9,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Requests by credential (azp)",
      "description": "`azp` is the OAuth2 authorized party -- it identifies WHICH credential was used, not who used it. `governance-auth-cli` is the governed path this platform issues (ADR-0010); anything else is a long-lived API key or a different client's own registration. The ratio here is the adoption metric for governance-auth itself.",
      "id": 10,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "__DS_LOKI__"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 23
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "__DS_LOKI__"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (azp) (count_over_time({service_name=\"envoy-ai-gateway\"} | json azp [1m]))",
          "queryType": "range",
          "legendFormat": "{{azp}}",
          "instant": false,
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "sum"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 15,
            "showPoints": "auto",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal",
              "group": "A"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Client x credential",
      "description": "The join that answers 'is this tool going through the governed path?'. A single client appearing under two azp values means some of its traffic bypasses governance-auth.",
      "id": 11,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "__DS_LOKI__"
